// Multi-turn memory sessions (15 sessions, 38 turns).
//
// The harness carries memory forward by applying each response's
// `memoryUpdates` verbatim into the next turn's `memory`, and by nothing else.
// That is exactly what the client does: M6 decision D1 made `sessionMemory.ts` a
// dumb carrier that applies no TTL, because `resolver.js` re-applies expiry to
// whatever the client sends, explicitly so the pipeline does not depend on the
// client having done it. So this file re-implements ZERO rules — had D1 gone the
// other way, the harness would have become a fourth home for the TTL table.
//
// TTLs under test (resolver.js): grade/subject/language are session-lived;
// `format` lasts 3 turns; `topic` lasts 2. A value set on turn T is usable on
// turns T+1 … T+ttl.
//
// FOUR LABEL FIELDS DO THE WORK HERE:
//   stated         -> must arrive with provenance `utterance`
//   inherited      -> must arrive with provenance `memory`
//   mustNotInherit -> memory holds it, but it has expired or been overridden;
//                     provenance `memory` here is STALENESS and is counted
//   notStated      -> provenance `utterance` here is a HALLUCINATION
//
// mem.007 is the one to read carefully. It reproduces the shape of the M6 live
// finding — a water-cycle worksheet inheriting `Subject: Mathematics` — and
// labels it as CORRECT, because session-lived subject inheritance is the design
// and the REMEMBERED provenance marker is the designed mitigation. The real
// defect there was upstream (the classifier not extracting the subject), and
// labelling designed behaviour as a failure would put the staleness metric to
// work measuring the wrong thing.

{"id":"mem.001","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"Plain carry-forward. grade and subject are session-lived and survive to turn 3.","turns":[{"utterance":"Generate a Class 5 maths worksheet on fractions and mixed numbers","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"fractions and mixed numbers","grade":"Class 3-5","subject":"Mathematics"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Now make a quiz on decimals","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"decimals"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 3-5","subject":"Mathematics"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Make a worksheet on percentages now","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"percentages"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 3-5","subject":"Mathematics"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.002","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"Explicit beats remembered — both grade and subject are restated and must arrive with provenance `utterance`, not `memory`.","turns":[{"utterance":"Make a quiz on algebra for class 8 maths","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"algebra","grade":"Class 6-8","subject":"Mathematics"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Now make a worksheet on the water cycle for class 4 science","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"water cycle","grade":"Class 3-5","subject":"Science"},"mustNotInherit":["grade","subject"],"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.003","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"TOPIC STALENESS. topic is set on turn 1 with a 2-turn TTL, so it is dead by turn 4. Inheriting it there would produce a confident worksheet about the Mughal empire when the teacher asked for a quiz about nothing in particular — the exact failure the short TTL exists to bound.","turns":[{"utterance":"Prepare a worksheet on the Mughal empire for class 7","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"Mughal empire","grade":"Class 6-8"},"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"How do I make that period interesting for them?","expected":{"decision":"passthrough","actionId":null,"slots":{}}},{"utterance":"What group activities would work for that chapter?","expected":{"decision":"passthrough","actionId":null,"slots":{}}},{"utterance":"Make a quiz now","expected":{"decision":"ask","actionId":"generate_assessment","askSlot":"topic","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 6-8"},"mustNotInherit":["topic"],"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.004","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"FORMAT DECAY. format is set on turn 1 with a 3-turn TTL and is dead by turn 5, so the format question has to be asked again.","turns":[{"utterance":"Create a worksheet on soil types for class 6","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"soil types","grade":"Class 6-8"},"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Which soil is best for growing wheat?","expected":{"decision":"passthrough","actionId":null,"slots":{}}},{"utterance":"How should I explain erosion to them?","expected":{"decision":"passthrough","actionId":null,"slots":{}}},{"utterance":"Any ideas for a field trip about that?","expected":{"decision":"passthrough","actionId":null,"slots":{}}},{"utterance":"Prepare something on rocks and minerals for the same class","expected":{"decision":"ask","actionId":"generate_assessment","askSlot":"format","slots":{"stated":{"topic":"rocks and minerals"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 6-8"},"mustNotInherit":["format"],"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.005","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"ASK-TURN ISOLATION — a hard gate. Turn 1 ends in a clarifying question, so it must emit NO memoryUpdates: a turn that ended in a question has settled nothing, and writing its half-formed reading into memory would let a guess outlive the question meant to resolve it. If `format: quiz` leaked from turn 1, turn 2 would silently prefill instead of asking.","turns":[{"utterance":"I need a quiz","expected":{"decision":"ask","actionId":"generate_assessment","askSlot":"topic","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz"},"notStated":["grade","subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Prepare one on the solar system for class 8","expected":{"decision":"ask","actionId":"generate_assessment","askSlot":"format","slots":{"stated":{"topic":"solar system","grade":"Class 6-8"},"mustNotInherit":["format"],"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.006","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"A coaching turn in the middle must not disturb memory — it writes nothing and clears nothing.","turns":[{"utterance":"Make a worksheet on adverbs for class 6 English","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"adverbs","grade":"Class 6-8","subject":"English"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Why do children confuse adverbs with adjectives?","expected":{"decision":"passthrough","actionId":null,"slots":{}}},{"utterance":"Create a quiz on tenses","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"tenses"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 6-8","subject":"English"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.007","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"THE M6 SHAPE, LABELLED AS CORRECT. A maths session followed by a water-cycle worksheet inherits Subject: Mathematics. That is the design — subject is session-lived and the teacher did not restate it — and the REMEMBERED provenance marker is the mitigation that lets them see and correct it. The real M6 defect was the classifier failing to extract the subject, which is measured by the slot metrics, not here. Labelling designed behaviour as staleness would aim the staleness metric at the wrong target.","turns":[{"utterance":"Make a quiz on long division for class 5 maths","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"long division","grade":"Class 3-5","subject":"Mathematics"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Now create a worksheet about the water cycle","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"water cycle"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 3-5","subject":"Mathematics"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.008","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"language is session-lived, so an explicit request on turn 1 carries to turn 2 with provenance `memory`.","turns":[{"utterance":"Make a worksheet on nouns for class 3 and write it in Hindi","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"nouns","grade":"Class 3-5","language":"hi"},"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount"]}}},{"utterance":"Now make a quiz on pronouns","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"pronouns"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 3-5","language":"hi"},"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.009","stratum":"memory","language":"hinglish","notes":"Carry-forward in Hinglish. Memory is language-agnostic — it stores canonical values, not phrases.","turns":[{"utterance":"Class 6 ke liye ganit ka worksheet banao gunankhand par","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"gunankhand","grade":"Class 6-8","subject":"Mathematics"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Ab ek quiz banao samikaran par","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"samikaran"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 6-8","subject":"Mathematics"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
