{"id":"mem.011","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"format alone is overridden while topic is restated; grade rides along from memory.","turns":[{"utterance":"Create a quiz on the freedom struggle for class 9","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"freedom struggle","grade":"Class 9-10"},"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Actually make it a worksheet on the same subject matter, partition of India","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"partition of India"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 9-10"},"mustNotInherit":["format"],"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.012","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"open_generator has no slots, so it neither reads nor writes memory. The following command must still find turn 1's values intact.","turns":[{"utterance":"Build a worksheet on electricity for class 10 science","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"electricity","grade":"Class 9-10","subject":"Science"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Open the generator page","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"open_generator","slots":{}}},{"utterance":"Make a quiz on magnetism","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"magnetism"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 9-10","subject":"Science"},"notStated":["difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.013","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"TOPIC AT THE TTL BOUNDARY. topic is set on turn 1 and turn 3 is the LAST turn on which it is still fresh (3 - 1 = 2, the TTL exactly). The complement of mem.003: an off-by-one in either direction fails one of the two.","turns":[{"utterance":"Draft a worksheet on the circulatory system for class 8","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"circulatory system","grade":"Class 6-8"},"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"How much detail is appropriate at that age?","expected":{"decision":"passthrough","actionId":null,"slots":{}}},{"utterance":"Make a quiz","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz"},"inherited":{"grade":"Class 6-8","topic":"circulatory system"},"notStated":["subject","difficulty","questionType","questionCount","language"]}}}]}
{"id":"mem.014","stratum":"memory","language":"en","notes":"A fully-specified second turn should inherit nothing at all — every slot it needs is stated.","turns":[{"utterance":"Make an easy quiz on plants for class 2 science","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"quiz","topic":"plants","grade":"Class 1-2","subject":"Science","difficulty":"easy"},"notStated":["questionType","questionCount","language"]}}},{"utterance":"Prepare a hard worksheet on chemical bonding for class 11 with 20 questions","expected":{"decision":"prefill","actionId":"generate_assessment","slots":{"stated":{"format":"worksheet","topic":"chemical bonding","grade":"Class 11-12","difficulty":"hard","questionCount":20},"mustNotInherit":["difficulty"],"notStated":["questionType","language"]}}}]}
